{"id":"e4c0a39a574d3382","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing.md","title":"ZFC Forcing4 Distributive Forcing","display":"df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing — ZFC Forcing4 Distributive Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing — ZFC Forcing4 Distributive Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[58-df-zfc-dense-open-family]]","[[58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing — ZFC Forcing4 Distributive Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3bf4287c83498be0\" href=\"?note=3bf4287c83498be0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-dense-open-family\">58-df-zfc-dense-open-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d259411e9c522740\" href=\"?note=d259411e9c522740\" title=\"58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset\">58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OpenDenseSubset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{OpenDenseSubset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3bf4287c83498be0\" href=\"?note=3bf4287c83498be0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-dense-open-family\">58-df-zfc-dense-open-family</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d259411e9c522740\" href=\"?note=d259411e9c522740\" title=\"58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset\">58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> is the registered three-place set-function predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(D,\\lambda,\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P))\n\\land\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(D),\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{105pt}\\to\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S\\!\\left(\\{p\\in\\mathbb P:\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(p\\in D(\\alpha))\\},\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\right)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(D,\\lambda,\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P))\n\\land\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(D),\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{105pt}\\to\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S\\!\\left(\\{p\\in\\mathbb P:\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(p\\in D(\\alpha))\\},\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\right)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Openness is essential: intersections of arbitrary dense subsets need not be dense even in distributive forcing notions.  Families are now quantified as three-place set functions rather than elements of an unregistered map class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-dense-open-family","status":"resolved","id":"3bf4287c83498b